OL,3,GNEWSABooker Prize nominee praises his
OL,4,Aschool teachers
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn author whose latest book has been
OL,7,Fnominated for the prestigious Booker
OL,8,FPrize said childhood boredom inspired
OL,9,Fhis creativity.
OL,11,FLuke Kennard, who grew up in Chard in
OL,12,FSomerset, has been shortlisted for
OL,13,FBlack Bag, which is based on an
OL,14,Fexperiment involving an actor sitting
OL,15,Fin a bin bag at the back of a lecture
OL,16,Fhall.
OL,18,FHe said, as a child, he had "quite a
OL,19,Flot of time to practice" his creative
OL,20,Fpassions.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
