OL,3,GNEWSABooker Prize nominee praises his
OL,4,Aschool teachers
OL,5,
OL,6,FKennard also praised his teachers at
OL,7,Fthe town's Holyrood Academy and said:
OL,8,F"It just can't be exaggerated how much
OL,9,Fdifference a teacher can make when they
OL,10,Ffind a kid who has a passion for their
OL,11,Fsubjects."
